+### Speech-to-Text and Transcription
+
+#### [Whisper](https://github.com/openai/whisper)
+> **Description:** Whisper is OpenAI's open source automatic speech recognition system built to handle multilingual transcription and translation across noisy, real-world audio. For podcasters, it is the baseline repo that powers draft transcripts, searchable show notes, subtitles, and rough edit logs. The README emphasizes robustness, broad language coverage, and simple Python usage, which makes it easy to batch-process interviews or back catalogs before handing results to editors. GitHub review on March 31, 2026 showed roughly `79k` stars, Python as the primary language, and an MIT license. Recent GitHub activity remained visible in 2026.
